    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Basically the title.\r\n\r\nI tried this, but got some weird behavior.\r\n```\r\n        require('mini.pick').builtin.help({}, {\r\n          mappings = {\r\n            choose = '',\r\n            choose_in_vsplit = '<CR>',\r\n          },\r\n        })\r\n```\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Basically the title.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I tried this, but got some weird behavior.</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"        require('mini.pick').builtin.help({}, {\n          mappings = {\n            choose = '',\n            choose_in_vsplit = '&lt;CR&gt;',\n          },\n        })\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">        require('mini.pick').builtin.help({}, {\n          mappings = {\n            choose = '',\n            choose_in_vsplit = '&lt;CR&gt;',\n          },\n        })\n</code></pre></div>",
    "bodyText": "Basically the title.\nI tried this, but got some weird behavior.\n        require('mini.pick').builtin.help({}, {\n          mappings = {\n            choose = '',\n            choose_in_vsplit = '<CR>',\n          },\n        })",
