            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "On the latest `main` there is now [`default_split` local option](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/7b210cc5207e36f562f6c1e83200d5dfc0a4451d/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1144-L1145). So now making `<CR>` open in vertical split is as easy as `:Pick help default_split='vertical'`. Thanks for the great question!",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">On the latest <code class=\"notranslate\">main</code> there is now <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/7b210cc5207e36f562f6c1e83200d5dfc0a4451d/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1144-L1145\"><code class=\"notranslate\">default_split</code> local option</a>. So now making <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;CR&gt;</code> open in vertical split is as easy as <code class=\"notranslate\">:Pick help default_split='vertical'</code>. Thanks for the great question!</p>",
            "bodyText": "On the latest main there is now default_split local option. So now making <CR> open in vertical split is as easy as :Pick help default_split='vertical'. Thanks for the great question!",
